{"seq":8,"slug":"ccus","title":"碳捕集利用与封存","stage":"DONE","category":"climate-energy-transition","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"碳捕集利用与封存\">碳捕集利用与封存</h1><p>净零并不意味着排放归零，而是让剩下减不掉的排放被人为移除冲抵。可水泥窑里石灰石分解的二氧化碳、钢铁高炉、化工裂解、长途航空，这些环节靠换电换氢都消不掉——它们才是 CCUS 真正要服务的对象。碳捕集利用与封存，就是为这批「难减排」环节准备的兜底工具，同时也是从大气里净移除存量碳、实现负排放的工程化路径。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 按一条完整的产业链顺序展开，四个章节层层递进。第一章「CCUS 基础」先回答「为什么需要它」和「它划不划算」：厘清减排、利用、负排放三种气候定位，揭示二氧化碳浓度如何贯穿全链决定捕集难度，并用技术成熟度与成本两把尺子说明瓶颈在钱而非技术。</p>\n<p>第二章「捕集技术」深入「怎么抓」。从最成熟、可加装到存量设施的燃烧后胺法，到从源头改造燃烧的燃烧前与富氧燃烧，再到把整个大气当碳源的直接空气捕集——三类技术对应基础章里不同浓度的碳源，权衡各异。</p>\n<p>第三章「运输与封存」处理「抓下来之后送到哪、怎么藏」。二氧化碳的相态管理是运输的隐形主线，地质封存的四重圈闭机制解释了永久性如何逐级加固，而监测体系则负责证明这份永久性确实成立——没有可信的监测，碳信用就无从签发。</p>\n<p>第四章「利用与政策」收束于「值不值、靠什么撑起来」。先算清利用的减排账（用了二氧化碳不等于减排），再讲清填补成本缺口的政策杠杆——美国 45Q、欧盟储存义务、自愿碳移除市场，最后用真实的全球项目数字盘点现实规模与未来鸿沟。</p>\n<p>四条主线如此咬合：基础定方向、捕集解决抓、运输封存解决藏、利用政策解决撑。读完会明白，CCUS 既不是解决气候问题的银弹，也不是化石能源的拖延伎俩，而是净零拼图里一块必要但有限、且高度依赖政策与基础设施协同的部分。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"CCUS 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"role-significance","title":"碳捕集的意义与角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations/role-significance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sources-pathways","title":"碳源与减排路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations/sources-pathways"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maturity-cost","title":"技术成熟度与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations/maturity-cost"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"capture","title":"捕集技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"post-combustion","title":"燃烧后捕集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/post-combustion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pre-oxy-combustion","title":"燃烧前与富氧燃烧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/pre-oxy-combustion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"direct-air-capture","title":"直接空气捕集 DAC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/direct-air-capture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"transport-storage","title":"运输与封存","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/transport-storage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"co2-transport","title":"CO2 运输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/transport-storage/co2-transport"},{"seq":2,"slug":"geological-storage","title":"地质封存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/transport-storage/geological-storage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-safety-monitoring","title":"封存安全与监测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/transport-storage/storage-safety-monitoring"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"utilization-policy","title":"利用与政策","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/utilization-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"co2-utilization","title":"CO2 化工与矿化利用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/utilization-policy/co2-utilization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-market-incentives","title":"碳市场与激励政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/utilization-policy/carbon-market-incentives"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-projects-outlook","title":"全球项目与展望","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/utilization-policy/global-projects-outlook"}]}]}